   <text:p text:style-name="P87">This looks better – notice how the fit line through the experimental data looks sensible. <text:s/>The P(r) function may need some extra work – notice how at large r values <text:span text:style-name="T72">it does not seem to stabilise. <text:s/>Let’s try using a larger range in the ‘Explore’ window - </text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87"><text:soft-page-break/></text:p>
