   <text:p text:style-name="P88"><text:span text:style-name="T73">Here we have decreased the minimum <text:tab/>distance to 90</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T65">Å</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T73">. You may wish to experiment with increasing the number of <text:tab/>points – here we have tried 20 rather than 1</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T74">5</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T73">. This may improve results for certain systems without too much of a computational penalty. Here the minimum is around 102</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T65">Å.</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P87"/>
